\"$L10\"]}]\n11:T40f,<h1>Fashion Boutique - LED Display &amp; Lighting Integration, Dubai</h1><p>A luxury fashion boutique in Dubai needed an integrated LED display and lighting solution that would showcase collections with accurate colour rendering wh</p><p>A luxury fashion boutique in Dubai needed an integrated LED display and lighting solution that would showcase collections with accurate colour rendering while creating an immersive brand experience for customers. The installation had to complement the store's minimalist design aesthetic without visual clutter.</p><p>Brightluxx designed a combined LED display and architectural lighting package. A slim indoor LED video wall behind the main display area runs curated fashion content and brand videos. High-CRI LED track lighting was installed throughout the store for perfect garment colour rendering. The entire system operates through a unified control panel, allowing staff to adjust lighting scenes and screen content for different collections, events, and seasons.</p><p>Location: Dubai, UAE</p>10:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Fashion Boutique - LED Display & Lighting Integration, Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"A luxury fashion boutique in Dubai needed an integrated LED display and lighting solution that would showcase collections with accurate colour rendering wh\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/case-studies/fashion-boutique-led-display-dubai\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T40d,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Article\", \"headline\": \"Fashion Boutique - LED Display & Lighting Integration, Dubai\", \"description\": \"A luxury fashi