ore for perfect garment colour rendering. The entire system operates through a unified control panel, allowing staff to adjust lighting scenes and screen content for different collections, events, and seasons.</p><p>Location: Dubai, UAE</p>3:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}]\n4:[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$12\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@13\"}]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L14\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$12\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Fashion Boutique - LED Display & Lighting Integration, Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"A luxury fashion boutique in Dubai needed an integrated LED display and lighting solution that would showcase collections with accurate colour rendering wh\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/case-studies/fashion-boutique-led-display-dubai\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{}]}]]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L16\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{}],\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"not-found\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",nul